# Scripts here are executed inside a Linux container. A CRLF line ending on
# the shebang turns "#!/usr/bin/with-contenv bashio" into a bad interpreter
# error that names a file which plainly exists -- an expensive thing to debug.
# This repo is authored on Windows, so pin it rather than rely on core.autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
